## 2. Public API Interoperability License

This section applies only to the RS Integration Public API identified below.
It does not change the license of the RS Integration mod as a whole, its
implementation, original assets, or any third-party component. Those remain
subject to Section 1 and the applicable third-party licenses.

### 2.1 Licensed API

"Licensed API" means the following public Java API packages distributed with
RS Integration:

```text
com.huanghuang.rsintegration.api
com.huanghuang.rsintegration.api.recipe
com.huanghuang.rsintegration.api.machine
com.huanghuang.rsintegration.api.execution
com.huanghuang.rsintegration.api.resonance
com.huanghuang.rsintegration.api.consumer
com.huanghuang.rsintegration.api.diagnostic
```

This section does not apply to any type marked
`org.jetbrains.annotations.ApiStatus.Internal`, any implementation class, any
network packet, or any package not listed above.

### 2.2 Grant

Subject to this license, you are granted a non-exclusive, worldwide,
royalty-free permission to:

1. compile your own mod, tool, or integration against an official, unmodified
